\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 12. Browser Redirect Is Not Payment Confirmation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is one of the most important architectural rules.\
NOWPayments supports:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
success_url\
cancel_url\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 but these URLs are 
\f0\b customer navigation mechanisms
\f2\b0 , not payment verification mechanisms.\
Therefore:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
Customer reaches /payment/success\
            
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
DO NOT activate account\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 Instead:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
Customer reaches /payment/success\
            
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Show "We're verifying your payment..."\
            
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Frontend reads application payment status\
            
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Backend/IPN updates status\
            
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
UI reflects actual backend state\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 The documentation separately identifies 
\f4\fs26 success_url
\f2\fs24  as the redirect destination and IPN/payment-status APIs as the mechanisms for determining payment status.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 13. Payment Detection\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Once the customer sends crypto:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
waiting\
    
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
confirming\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 NOWPayments has detected the blockchain payment.\
Our application:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
payment.internalStatus = "processing"\
\
order.status = "payment_processing"\
\
user.accountStatus = "pending_payment"\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 The account is still inactive.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 14. Confirmation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 NOWPayments:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
confirming\
     
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
confirmed\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 The documentation states that each currency has its own confirmation requirements.\
Our application remains:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
payment = processing\
order = payment_processing\
account = pending_payment\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Do not activate here.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 15. Sending\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 NOWPayments:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
confirmed\
     
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
sending\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 This means NOWPayments is sending funds to the merchant wallet.\
Our internal state remains:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
payment = processing\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 No activation yet.\
