\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 17. IPN Processing\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 NOWPayments sends a POST request to:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
ipn_callback_url\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 The request contains:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
x-nowpayments-sig\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 in the header.\
The body resembles the payment-status response.\
Our Cloud Function endpoint:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
POST /nowpayments/ipn\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 must be designed specifically for this purpose.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 18. IPN Signature Verification\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 The backend must verify:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
x-nowpayments-sig\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 before processing the event.\
According to the supplied documentation:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
1. Receive IPN\
2. Sort payload keys\
3. Recursively sort nested objects\
4. JSON.stringify the sorted object\
5. Generate HMAC-SHA512 using IPN secret\
6. Compare generated signature with x-nowpayments-sig\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 NOWPayments provides this exact verification approach in its Node.js example.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 If signature is invalid:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b0\fs26 \cf0 \
STOP\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 Do not:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
update payment\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
activate account\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
fulfill order\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
trust the payload\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 19. Payment Verification\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 After successful IPN authentication:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
IPN\
 
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
extract payment_id\
 
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
GET /v1/payment/:payment_id\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 The payment-status endpoint returns the actual payment information and requires the same API key used to create the payment.\
This gives us an additional verification layer:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
IPN signature\
       +\
NOWPayments payment-status API\
       +\
Our Firestore order\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 Only when these agree should we process the payment.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
