\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 40. The One-Line Mental Model\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 The entire architecture can be remembered as:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
NOWPayments tells us WHAT HAPPENED.\
Firebase Cloud Functions decide WHAT IT MEANS.\
Firestore records WHAT WE BELIEVE.\
React displays WHAT THE USER CAN DO.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 And the ultimate activation gate is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 \
NOWPayments finished\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
IPN signature valid\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Payment independently verified\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Order validated\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Amount + asset validated\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Not already fulfilled\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
Firestore transaction\
        
\f5 \uc0\u8595 
\f4 \
USER = ACTIVE\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 That is the payment architecture the coding assistant should implement.
